[[1,15951,0,2,0,2,"2014-07-04T09:54:00","Terminal-Psychosis","[e]",[],"<p>I agree with everything. From strictly a user's perspective, I REALLY miss the pic / vid expandos and text editing helpers that come with RES.</p>\n<p>For me that would be the first important thing. I really want WVEnhancementSuite!</p>\n<p>On the backend though, you have some great ideas to make moderation and transparency better for everyone.</p>"],[1,16635,0,2,0,2,"2014-07-06T09:40:00","Atko","",[],"<p>Just commenting to say that this list is a pretty good mirror of my todo list :) Thanks for compiling and maintaining this!</p>"],[1,18620,0,1,0,1,"2014-07-15T13:41:00","Atko","",[],"<p>&quot;A list with all the default subverses is shown to a user when first signing up, to see if the user would like to subscribe to those subverses, and perhaps also the trending subverses at that time and recently made subverses&quot; is implemented in a different way as <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/r2zAc0c.png\">seen here</a>.</p>"],[1,18711,0,1,0,1,"2014-07-15T22:11:00","Atko","",[],"<p>&quot;Ability to disable a subverse custom stylesheet&quot; is also <a href=\"http://whoaverse.com/v/announcements/comments/19381\">implemented</a>. ;)</p>"],[1,21116,0,1,0,1,"2014-08-19T08:52:00","Atko","",[],"<p>It's been a while since this was updated :p I am running out of things to implement and could use some community input with prioritizing missing features.</p>"]]
